@jun23_finish
title: Close the June desk
view-if: june_march_2023_done = 1 and dorota_2023_done = 1 and nowa_solidarnosc_dissolved = 1
on-arrival: june_2023_done = 1

Warsaw filled on 4 June and the party that called the march claimed the
anniversary with it. A second death put the abortion law back where nobody
governing wanted it, and the splinter that was going to replace us lasted a
week. The campaign is already running.

